      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(246,243,237,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">No water at your place off the Wenatchee River? We fix well pumps in Cashmere the same day, often within a few hours. Free estimates, licensed and insured.</p>
